{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103420","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103420","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1710342001:1":{"text":"Quackoo! Quack! Quackkk!","source_cn":"嘎！嘎！呜！咕！嘎嘎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6838B7ACC5E169B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710342002:1":{"text":"Is this... Rowan's pet? Why is it here by itself? It looks so distressed.","source_cn":"这是……罗万的那只宠物？它怎么会独自跑来这里？而且看起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29D4D250497D46C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710342003:1":{"text":"Quackkk! Quackoo!","source_cn":"嘎嘎！咕嘎！呜——！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D30F18C67B60258","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710342004:1":{"text":"I think it's trying to tell us something, but I can't understand a word...","source_cn":"它好像有很重要的话想对我们说，但我完全听不懂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DC5DCD7D029504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710342005:1":{"text":"Ah... I see...","source_cn":"嗯嗯……原来是这么回事啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A98544920DA3A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710342006:1":{"text":"Yikes, that's brutal.","source_cn":"啧啧啧，真是惨绝人寰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25CD25CED5F1BD0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710342007:1":{"text":"Little fox, can you understand what Bradduck is saying? Can you translate it for us?","source_cn":"小狐狸，你能听懂它想说什么吗？你能向我们转达一下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC051D288CC320B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710342008:1":{"text":"Hmph, you were just trying to drive me away a moment ago, remember?","source_cn":"哼，你们刚刚不是还联合起来想把我赶走嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x491C164A4CEFE4A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710342009:1":{"text":"We didn't mean that, it's just... anyway, please help us this time!","source_cn":"我们没有要赶你走的意思，只是……总之，先拜托了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F9FA53EB6128D0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710342010:1":{"text":"Hmph, count yourself lucky I have a heart of gold. I'll tell you what he said.","source_cn":"好在我是只善良慷慨的狐狸，就大方帮你们转译一下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9223FE3A6C789E02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710342011:1":{"text":"Here goes: \"Oh no! The Mithril Consortium's gone belly-up! Rowan ran off with all the money!\"","source_cn":"这只鸭子说，“不好啦！秘银商会破产了，罗万带着全部财产...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DD0AB8AE437AF29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710342012:1":{"text":"Quack, quack, quackkk!","source_cn":"嘎嘎嘎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1329A213E9DE0B76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710342013:1":{"text":"Little fox, this isn't a joking matter!","source_cn":"小狐狸！现在不是开玩笑的时候！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95F1D65E705D9645","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710342014:1":{"text":"Tsk, you've got no sense of humor. I'm a fox, alright—how could I possibly understand him?","source_cn":"哎呀，真没幽默感。我是狐狸嘛，狐狸怎么听得懂鸭子的语言呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80D2B58BD578D97F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710342015:1":{"text":"Quack! Quack! Ngh! Quackoo!","source_cn":"嘎！嘎！呜！咕！嘎嘎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF63D57ED54103F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_in